  - m_Id: 11635609152339968
    m_Localized: <size=36>This unit is affected by combat strategy. Under <color=#00FFFF>Attack
      Mode</color>,  none Supporter characters reduce their detection range by <color=#FF6060>50%</color>,
      with their effect trigger rate reduced by <color=#FF6060>25%</color>. Under
      <color=#00FFFF>Defense Mode</color>, none Deffender characters retreat to the
      furthest detection point to the most front enemy in detected, with their effect
      trigger rate increased by <color=#FF6060>25%</color>.</size>
